body:
Created by **celso**, 21st Jun 2011. _(originally [Lighthouse ticket #1788](http://cakephp.lighthouseapp.com/projects/42648/tickets/1788))_:

---
#### What I did

Departamento -> Distancia <- AreaExame

defaultDb contains Distancia & AreaExame
globalDb  contains Departamento 

``` php
class Departamento extends AppModel{

    var $useDbConfig = 'global';

    var $hasAndBelongsToMany = array(
        'AreaExame' => array(
            'className' => 'AreaExame',
            'with'  => 'Distancia',
            'joinTable' => 'distancias',
            'foreignKey' => 'departamento_id',
            'associationForeignKey' => 'area_exame_id'
        ), 
    ); 

}

class Distancia extends AppModel{

    var $belongsTo = array(
        'Departamento' => array(
            'foreignKey' => 'departamento_id',
        ),
        'AreaExame' => array(
            'foreignKey' => 'area_exame_id'
        )

    );

}

class AreaExame extends AppModel{

    var $useTable = 'areas_exame';

    var $hasAndBelongsToMany = array(
        'Departamento' => array(
            'className' => 'Departamento',
            'with'  => 'Distancia',
            'joinTable' => 'distancias',
            'foreignKey' => 'area_exame_id',
            'associationForeignKey' => 'departamento_id'
        )
    ); 


}

```
#### What happened

``` sql

SELECT `Departamento`.`id`, `Departamento`.`DeDepartamento`, `Departamento`.`Codigo`, `Departamento`.`DeLogradouro`, `Departamento`.`DeComplemento`, `Departamento`.`DeBairro`, `Departamento`.`DeCidade`, `Departamento`.`CEP`, `Departamento`.`diretoria_id`, `Departamento`.`municipio_id`, `Distancia`.`id`, `Distancia`.`distancia`, `Distancia`.`area_exame_id`, `Distancia`.`departamento_id` FROM `departamentos` AS `Departamento` JOIN `distancias` AS `Distancia` ON (`Distancia`.`area_exame_id` = 1 AND `Distancia`.`departamento_id` = `Departamento`.`id`) 
```

1146: Table 'global.distancias' doesn't exist
#### What I expected to happen

Correct Join in Habtm ! Because distancia is from a differente database from Departamento !
I never have problems with HasMany, BelongsTo or HasOne in different dbs, but is my first case with HABTM...tested in cake 1.2.10 and 1.3.10
